sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / AI Agent
    participant API as API
    participant X402 as 402 Payment
    participant Regional as Regional Node

    Note over U,Regional: Discovery
    U->>+API: GET /regions
    API-->>-U: regions[], pricing

    Note over U,Regional: Session Creation
    U->>+API: POST /session/create {region, minutes, mode}
    alt x402 enabled
        API->>U: 402 Payment Required
        U->>X402: Pay (EVM/USDC)
        X402-->>U: Payment proof
        U->>API: Retry with payment proof
    end
    API-->>-U: token + session (proxy) OR wireguard_config (wireguard)

    alt Proxy mode
        Note over U,Regional: Use proxy
        loop Until session expires
            U->>+API: GET/POST /fetch (Bearer token) {url, method?}
            API->>Regional: Forward request
            Regional->>API: Response
            API-->>-U: Response
        end
        U->>+API: GET /session/me (Bearer token)
        API-->>-U: status, credit_seconds, expires_at
    else WireGuard mode
        Note over U,Regional: Use WireGuard
        U->>U: Configure client with wireguard_config
        U->>Regional: Connect VPN tunnel
        Note over U,Regional: All traffic flows through region
    end

    Note over U,Regional: Top-up (optional)
    U->>+API: POST /session/:id/topup {minutes}
    alt x402 enabled
        API->>U: 402 Payment Required
        U->>X402: Pay
        U->>API: Retry with payment proof
    end
    API-->>-U: new credit_seconds, token (proxy)
